<h3><u>Alma waley</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Ae alamdar e wafa..(4)<br />
ek tere sahare par zainab yasrab se maqtal aai thi<br />
alma waley..(2) ha meri chadar ke rakhwaley<br />
rabba teri khair kare<br />
alma waley..</p>

<p>1. Zainab ki dharas tera alam, bhai ka dilasa tera alam<br />
hai ehle haram ke sar ki rida, hurmat ka khulasa tera alam<br />
chadar kaise..(2)<br />
cheenenge ye barchiyo waley<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>2. Dariya pe lagaye hai pehre, jaa tod ghuroore batil ko<br />
tu jaake mita de duniya se, mazloom akhi ke qatil ko<br />
cheen le dariya..(2)<br />
aaghosh e ali ke paale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>3. Hai waqt teri saqqai ka, ab rog bani hai tishna labi<br />
marjae na ye pyase bache, in sab ko hai tujh se aas badi<br />
pyaas bujha de..(2)<br />
kehte hai zaba ke chaale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>4. Ye mashk e sakina dariya se, bhar lao mere pyare bhayya<br />
in nanhe nanhe bacho ka, hai pyaas ke maare haal bura<br />
jaldi aana..(2)<br />
mashkeeza gale me daale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>5. Zainab ki ummeedo par paani, pani ki talab ne pher diya<br />
mashkiza bhara khaime ko chala, aada ne jari ko gher diya<br />
pyaase bache..(2)<br />
kehte rahe kooze sambhale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>6. Maskhiza chhida bazu bhi kate, ek aankh me uske teer laga<br />
be dast jari ghode se gira, girte hue di aaqa ko sada<br />
sarwar pohche..(2)<br />
hoto&#39;n pe yahi the naale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>7. Sarwar se kaha tha ghazi ne, ae maula meri hai arzi yahi<br />
khaime me na lejana mujhko, takti hai sakina raah meri<br />
baithi hai wo..(2)<br />
raste pe nigaahe daale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>8. Zainab ne jo dekha aate alam, bachi se kaha dekho to zara<br />
wo shere jari aata hai mera, ab pani tumhe mil jaega<br />
milke uthao..(2)<br />
tum haath duaon wale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>9. Mazhar wo qayamat ka manzar, farhan ye kehke rone laga<br />
jab qaidi bani aulade nabi, deti thi sadaa binte zehra<br />
shaam chali mai..(2)<br />
asghar hai tere hawale<br />
rabba teri khair kare</p>

<p>alma waley..(2) ha meri chadar ke rakhwaley<br />
rabba teri khair kare<br />
ae alamdar e wafa..(4)</p>
</p>
